@startuml
title A-COP 계획 기반 Case 생명주기 — 분류·Context·Team·승인
skinparam backgroundColor #faf9ff
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequence {
  LifeLineBorderColor #7c3aed
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #f5f3ff
  ParticipantBorderColor #7c3aed
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #ede9fe
  ArrowColor #4b5563
}

actor "고객 / 개인 AI" as Client
participant "API Gateway" as Gateway
participant "Case Runtime" as Runtime
participant "Classifier" as Classifier
participant "Controller" as Controller
participant "TeamRegistry" as Registry
participant "ContextBroker" as Context
participant "TeamExecutor" as Executor
participant "선택된 Team" as Team
participant "Core 2\nAction & Approval" as Core2
actor "운영자" as Operator

Client -> Gateway: Case 요청 (REST/MCP)
Gateway -> Gateway: 인증·scope·ownership 검사
Gateway -> Runtime: Case 생성
Runtime -> Runtime: new → classifying
Runtime -> Classifier: 인라인 분류
Classifier --> Runtime: intent / issue / sentiment
Runtime -> Runtime: classifying → routing
Runtime --> Client: Case view / case_id

Client -> Controller: 실행 또는 resume
Controller -> Registry: capability resolve
Registry --> Controller: TeamManifest + execution_type
Controller -> Context: ContextPack 요청
Context --> Controller: 최소 ContextPack
Controller -> Controller: TeamTask 구성
Controller -> Executor: TeamTask 전달
Executor -> Team: LOCAL 실행 또는 A2A 위임
Team --> Executor: TeamResult
Executor --> Controller: 정규화된 TeamResult

alt 추가 입력 필요
  Controller -> Runtime: running → waiting_input
  Runtime --> Client: 질문 / resume token
  Client -> Controller: 추가 입력
  Controller -> Runtime: waiting_input → resuming → running
else 외부 callback 대기
  Controller -> Runtime: running → waiting_external
  Executor --> Controller: callback / Artifact
  Controller -> Runtime: waiting_external → resuming → running
else ActionProposal 있음
  Controller -> Core2: 근거·최신 상태·scope 대조
  alt 승인 필요
    Core2 -> Runtime: running → waiting_approval
    Runtime --> Operator: 승인 요청
    Operator -> Core2: 승인 / 거절
    Core2 -> Core2: 실행 직전 재검증·idempotency·audit
    Core2 --> Controller: ActionResult
    Controller -> Runtime: resuming → running
  else 자동 실행 가능
    Core2 -> Core2: 실행 직전 재검증·audit
    Core2 --> Controller: ActionResult
  end
else 완료 응답
  Controller -> Runtime: running → resolved
  Runtime --> Client: 응답·근거·trace
else 근거 불일치·실패·timeout
  Controller -> Runtime: escalated / failed / unknown 기록
  Runtime --> Operator: 운영자 handoff + audit
end
@enduml
